高可处两年徒刑或2000万韩元罚款。特斯拉将这类设备视为网络安全威胁，认为其会引入软件漏洞，增加黑客攻击风险。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #0052d9; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2;\">CORE 03</section><section style=\"margin-left: 12px; flex: 1; height: 1px; background-color: rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.15);\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">大疆 Osmo Pocket 4 全能套装包装曝光：1 英寸传感器、107GB 内置存储</section></section><section style=\"width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-product-hub/main/data/images/ac016da41eaffea46119771ab81e27f4.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; max-height: 600px; height: auto; border: none; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;\" /></section><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 30px 20px;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">大疆 Osmo Pocket 4 全能套装零售包装盒照片曝光，确认了该手持云台相机的核心规格。其主要配置包括：1英寸传感器、14档动态范围、10位 D-Log 色彩模式、2倍无损变焦、107GB 内置高速存储（传输速度800MB/s，无microSD卡槽）。此外，它还搭载智能跟随7.0、OsmoAudio四声道输出、三轴增稳及可旋转触控屏。全能套装内含丰富配件，如补光灯、增广镜、无线麦克风发射器、磁吸背夹等。目前产品已进入量产阶段，中国经销商已获现货，预计于2026年4月20日全球正式发布。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #0052d9; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.2;\">CORE 04</section><section style=\"margin-left: 12px; flex: 1; height: 1px; background-color: rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.15);\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">微软 Win11 新版 Copilot 内置完整 Edge 浏览器，内存占用飙升</section></section><section style=\"width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-product-hub/main/data/images/03a971fe01cbf1a4694718ea36dfce4d.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; max-height: 600px; height: auto; border: none; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;\" /></section><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 30px 20px;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 0.8px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">微软为Windows 11推送新版Copilot应用，其核心变化是弃用原生WinUI框架，转而内置一个完整的、独立版本的Microsoft Edge浏览器（而非轻量的WebView2控件）。这导致应用体积和内存占用急剧增加：后台运行最高约500MB，交互使用时内存占用飙升至约1GB，而旧版原生Copilot内存占用不足100MB。安装包分析证实其包含完整的Edge二进制文件（如msedge.exe）及各类组件。尽管新版界面与网页版一致且运行流畅，但此举被批评加剧了系统臃肿，抵消了微软的优化努力。</section><section style=\"margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.5; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 1px;\"></section><section style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: #0052d9; opacity: 0.2; border-radius: 1px;\"></section></section><section style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #0052d9; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;\">SYS.ACTIVE</section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0 0 35px 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 82, 217, 0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0052d9; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 24px 20px 20px 20px;\"><s